      "extract": "In this section we find a new energy $\\mathcal{E}^{\\alpha,p}(\\solu)$ applied to maps $\\solu: \\R/\\Z \\to \\S^2$ so that any critical knot (parametrized by arc-length) induces a critical $\\S^2$-valued map $\\solu$ and vice versa. The main result in this section is the following equivalence between an energy $\\mathcal{E}^{\\alpha,p}$ which will be defined below and the O'hara energy $\\mathcal{O}^{\\alpha,p}$.",
